=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>A Motley Crew</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">When you're not running rituals, chat up your friends in the Hub: </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Amabel \u2013 A skillful mechanic with a cheerful personality. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Orson \u2013 Brains of the operation, with a flair of dark magic. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Lucien \u2013  A mysterious, deep-pocketed vampire keeping the operation afloat.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Learn their story and gain useful tips!  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2294640/extras/motley_crew.png?t=1744098300\" /></p>","developers":["Third Spirit Games"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Early Access","id":"70"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2294640/header.jpg?t=1744098300","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"Copyright 2025 Third Spirit Games Ltd. All rights Reserved.","linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257117525,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257117525/movie480.mp4?t=1742665177","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257117525/movie_max.mp4?t=1742665177"},"name":"Early Access Release Announcement Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257117525/871b93a85436ce789d11f3653f1168046144bb9d/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1742665177","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257117525/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1742665177","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257117525/movie_max_vp9.webm?t=1742665177"}}],"name":"Letifer",